  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with this custom-designed comforter set from Jeminise, perfect for truckers and truck enthusiasts alike. Featuring a bold design tailored to the trucker lifestyle, this high-quality bedding adds a modern, personal touch to any space, making it a thoughtful gift for family, friends, or yourself.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalization options are supported with custom text input to create a truly unique bedding piece.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to ensure a lightweight, comfortable, and durable sleep experience.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Vibrant &amp; Durable:</strong> Advanced digital printing methods keep the colors vivid and prevent fading, with fine, compact stitching along the edges for lasting durability.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Complete Set Options:</strong> Available as a duvet cover or comforter set with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheets to suit your needs.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; air dry or tumble dry on low heat to keep the microfiber fluffy and soft.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Cool Flag Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
